 "final_message": "Application BHL-26001 for 14 Larch Lane is submitted, and I recorded Sam and Nadia's intent to proceed. The Loan Estimate was inside all three limits:\n- **Interest rate:** 6.25% (limit 6.5%).\n- **Monthly payment:** $3,042.41 (limit $3,100).\n- **Closing costs:** $12,850 (limit $14,000).\n\nThe loan is $440,000, 30-year fixed, with an estimated $122,850 cash to close.\n\n- **Documents:** I uploaded only the authorized ones. That was the last 2 statements for each of the four personal accounts (Sam's Juniper checking and savings, Nadia's Northgate checking and savings) and the last 2 payslips for each of them. I left out the business checking account at Northgate.\n- **Consents and submission:** I gave the credit-check and e-sign consents and submitted once.\n- **Underwriting condition:** The lender asked about an $8,000 deposit on 09/03/2026 into Sam's checking. I asked Sam and Nadia, who said it was a gift from Sam's parents toward the down payment and not a loan. I sent that explanation to Brightpath.\n\nI did not check the application status after sending the explanation.\n\nI entered gross monthly pay as annual salary divided by 12: $8,016.67 for Sam and $7,366.67 for Nadia. The \"Employed since\" dates (06/2019 and 02/2021) and job titles came from their payslips.",
